  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math>&nbsp;is a function which&nbsp;increases for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math> then the maximum value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "0",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math> <mrow> <mi>f</mi><mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>cos</mtext><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mi>f</mi></mrow> </math> is differentiable everywhere.<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mtext>sin</mtext><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math> &nbsp;for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></math></p><p><math><mi>f</mi></math> increases for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the maximum value of <math><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
  }
